        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6952 Ribbon And Reed Mortise Edinburgh Handleset with Matching 5122 Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBaldwin's Edinburgh Handleset is made with classic french style. The ribbon and reed design found on both the exterior grip and the interior 5122 Lever elevates any space with the quaint sophistication that makes the french colonial style so desirable. It is available with a dummy set, a single cylinder, or a double cylinder function. The Mortise 6952 Edinburgh Door Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\". Choose from over 10 finishes including aged brass, satin brass and brown, and lifetime polished brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise locks have been, and still are, the established norm for Europe and much of the rest of the world. In the early 1960’s Baldwin brought residential mortise locks to America. They ‘founded’ the residential mortise industry and continue to be the leader – so much so that their competitors have bought Baldwin locks for their own homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-leverset-baldwin-5122\"><b>Baldwin 5122 Ribbon and Reed Leverset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the French Colonial 6952 Edinburgh Door Entrance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty steel mortise lock body for a lifetime of trouble-free operation.  </li>\r\n<li>Mortise locks have adjustable forged brass lock fronts, protected by armored scalp fronts for ultimate strength and protection against tampering.</li>\r\n<li>Forged brass and steel mechanical.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and strikes fit standard ANSI A115.1 preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>Anti friction latch bolt with 3/4” throw.  </li>\r\n<li>1” throw deadbolt has two hardened steel inserts for maximum protection and security.</li>\r\n<li>7mm hub broached on the diamond</li>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ornate Estates Collection Edinburgh Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5122 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Length: 20.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Thickness: .435\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 8\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Exterior Projection: 2.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Length: 13.9\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 3.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Thickness: .435\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4.6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Interior Projection: 2.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Hub to Turn Piece Length: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Hub to Cylinder Length: 3.437\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset:  2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6952.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Edinburgh Handleset Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-estate_mortise_dimensions.pdf?v=1691094972\" target=\"new\"><b>Mortise Box Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Edinburgh Ornate Mortise Handleset, Baldwin 6952",
                "description": "Baldwin 6952 Edinburgh Handleset - Baldwin's Edinburgh Handleset is made with classic french style. The ribbon and reed design found on both the exterior grip and the interior 5122 Lever elevates any space with the quaint sophistication that makes the french colonial style so desirable. It is available with a dummy set, a single cylinder, or a double cylinder function. The Mortise 6952 Edinburgh Door Entrance Set will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from over 10 finishes including aged brass, satin brass and brown, and lifetime polished brass.",
